{
  "chapter": "ammo",
  "quests": [
    {
      "key": "gg.ammo.intro",
      "title": "Ammo Logistics",
      "tier": "LV",
      "desc": [
        "A gun is only as good as its supply line. In GregGuns, ammunition is not crafted: it is produced, from GregTech parts, in a machine of its own. This chapter teaches that production line from the first brass foil to a multi-bay Ammunition Works, and it is why a big arsenal is a base project rather than a pocketful of lucky drops.",
        "The plan: make the parts (foil cases and lead or steel slugs), press the three LV calibers in the Ammo Press, turn rounds into magazines, automate the line with item pipes, and stockpile. Later quests cover grenades, heavy rounds, charging electric gear, fuel tanks, and the Works that runs the whole thing in bulk.",
        "To open the chapter, hold any LV round: sixteen 9mm or rifle bullets, or eight shotgun shells. If you finished the LV Ammo Press and 9mm quests, you already have them.",
        "[note]Ammo Press recipes have their own tab in NEI. Press U on a round to see where it is used.[/note]"
      ],
      "pre": [
