    {
      "key": "gg.ammo.magazines",
      "title": "Magazines in the Press",
      "tier": "LV",
      "desc": [
        "Magazines are two press runs. The first makes eight empties from two steel plates, eight small steel springs and Mechanical Parts T2. The second fills them: four empties and twelve 9mm bullets make four loaded pistol magazines. One machine covers the whole chain.",
        "Hold four empty and four loaded magazines to finish. For a quick single refill you can also craft an empty magazine with three bullets at a crafting table.",
        "[note]Sneak and right-click a loaded magazine to unload it, and the press can start over.[/note]"
      ],
